  "grammar_observation": {
    "target_language": "Heddiw: mae Mali'n agor, cau, edrych a helpu. Ddoe: agorodd Mali, caeodd Mali, edrychodd Mali a helpodd Mali. Gofyn → gofynnodd; ateb → atebodd.",
    "bridge_language": "For one completed past event with a third-person subject, these regular short forms end in -odd; use the taught stem shown in each pair, for example agor → agorodd and gofyn → gofynnodd."
  },
